<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/strigops-habroptilus> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A large, flightless, nocturnal parrot with moss-green feathers and an owl-like face. It is the heaviest parrot in the world. Males gather at display courts and make deep booming calls that carry for kilometres. It breeds only in years when rimu trees fruit heavily. All living birds are on predator-free islands and are managed one by one."@en ;
