<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/apteryx-mantelli> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A flightless, nocturnal bird with coarse brown feathers like hair, and nostrils at the tip of its long bill. It finds worms and insect larvae by smell. The female lays one of the largest eggs relative to body size of any bird, and the male incubates it. It lives in forest and scrub of the North Island."@en ;
