<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/chalcites-lucidus> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A small cuckoo with metallic green upperparts and a white breast with bronze bars. Its upslurred whistle is heard in New Zealand in spring. It lays its eggs in the nests of the grey warbler. Birds that breed in New Zealand spend the southern winter in the Solomon Islands and the Bismarck Archipelago, a sea crossing of about 3,000 km."@en ;
