<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/urodynamis-taitensis> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A large, slim cuckoo with a long barred tail, brown above and streaked below. It breeds only in New Zealand, where it lays its eggs in the nests of whitehead, yellowhead and brown creeper. In the southern winter it spreads across a vast area of the tropical Pacific, from Palau to French Polynesia."@en ;
