<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/megadyptes-antipodes> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A penguin with pale yellow eyes and a yellow band that runs from the eyes around the back of the head. It nests in coastal forest and scrub, apart from its neighbours, on the south-east coast of the South Island, Stewart Island and the sub-Antarctic islands. Disease, warmer seas and fishing bycatch have caused a steep decline on the mainland."@en ;
