<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/trichoglossus-moluccanus> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A noisy, fast-flying parrot with a blue head, a red and yellow breast and a green back. Flocks feed on nectar and pollen with a brush-tipped tongue, and gather at night in large, loud roosts in city trees. It was once treated as part of the same species as the coconut lorikeet of Melanesia."@en ;
