<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/trichoglossus-haematodus> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A lorikeet of the islands of Melanesia, from New Guinea to Vanuatu and New Caledonia. Its plumage is like that of the rainbow lorikeet but with a darker blue-black head. Until recent revisions the name Trichoglossus haematodus covered the rainbow lorikeet of Australia as well, so many older Australian records carry this name."@en ;
