<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/ardenna-tenuirostris> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A dark shearwater that breeds in huge colonies in burrows on islands of south-eastern Australia and Tasmania. Its chicks are harvested as muttonbirds in Tasmania. After breeding, birds fly to the North Pacific and the Bering Sea and return to their colonies within a few days of the same date each year."@en ;
