<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/falco-peregrinus> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A powerful falcon with a dark hood and moustache, blue-grey back and finely barred underparts. It hunts birds in flight with a steep dive, the stoop, in which it reaches more than 300 km/h. The pesticide DDT caused its decline in the twentieth century. It now nests on city buildings and bridges on most continents."@en ;
