<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/promerops-cafer> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A brown sunbird-like bird with a very long tail, found only in the fynbos of south-western South Africa. It feeds on the nectar of proteas and pollinates them. In the breeding season the male flies over his territory with his tail jerking and his wings making a rattling sound."@en ;
