<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/spheniscus-demersus> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A black and white penguin with a black band across the breast and a pink patch of bare skin above each eye. It breeds on islands and a few mainland beaches of South Africa and Namibia, including Boulders Beach near Cape Town. Overfishing of sardines and anchovies has reduced the population by more than 90 % in a century."@en ;
