<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/bostrychia-hagedash> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A large, grey-brown ibis with a long, down-curved bill and green and purple gloss on the wings. Its loud 'ha-ha-de-dah' call is a familiar sound at dawn in African towns. It probes lawns and wet ground for worms and insect larvae, and has spread into cities with garden irrigation."@en ;
