<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/struthio-camelus> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "The largest living bird, flightless, with a long neck and powerful legs that can run at 70 km/h. The male is black with white wing and tail feathers. Several females lay their eggs in one nest, which the dominant female and the male incubate. It lives in open savanna and semi-desert of Africa."@en ;
