<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/nectarinia-famosa> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A sunbird of southern and eastern Africa. The breeding male is metallic green with long central tail feathers and yellow tufts at the sides of the breast, and the female is olive-brown. It feeds on nectar of aloes, proteas and red-hot pokers, and catches small insects."@en ;
