<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/cardinalis-cardinalis> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A crested songbird. The male is bright red with a black face, and the female is buff with red on the wings and tail. Both sexes sing a clear whistled song. It lives all year in woodland edges, thickets and gardens of eastern North America and is the state bird of seven states."@en ;
