<https://example.org/birds/vocab/taxon/buteo-swainsoni> <https://example.org/birds/def/account> "A slim hawk of the western prairies of North America. Almost the whole population migrates in large flocks through Central America to winter on the pampas of Argentina, where pesticide poisoning killed thousands of birds in the 1990s. In Argentina it follows ploughs and eats grasshoppers."@en ;
